# OpenMoHAA Server Bans File
# Format: <type> <ip> <subnet>[:<reason>]
#   type:    0 = ban, 1 = exception
#   ip:      IPv4 or IPv6 address
#   subnet:  number of bits in the network prefix (IPv4: 1-32, IPv6: 1-128)
#   reason:  optional text shown to the banned player
#
# Examples:
#   0 192.168.1.100 32:cheating
#   0 10.0.0.0 8:range ban
#   1 192.168.1.1 32:trusted admin
#   0 2001:db8::1 128
#
# This file is managed by the server. Edit while the server is
# stopped, or use 'rehashbans' via RCON to reload changes.
